   "en": "and Dido and the Trojan leader will find their way to the very same cave. I will be there, and if I can be sure of your goodwill, I will join them in a lasting marriage, and make her his own. This will be their wedding.' Venus, who had no wish to oppose her as she asked, agreed, and smiled at the trick that she had seen through.",
